{"v":4,"catch":"《Bandit Buster: Western》– 停止匪徒，拯救小鎮，並小心爆炸驚喜！","desc":"《Bandit Buster: Western》是一款充滿樂趣和動作的遊戲，玩家將在一個充滿活力的低多邊形西部小鎮中扮演警長。你的任務是什麼？消滅恐嚇城市的匪徒！但要小心——有些匪徒躲在平民背後，地圖上還散布著爆炸桶。運用你的智慧和快速反應來保護小鎮的安全，同時避免意外傷害。這款快節奏的冒險遊戲非常適合兒童，在你與一波波的無賴鬥爭的同時，將讓你保持高度警覺，並為狂野西部重建和平！","publisher":"Eclipse Interactive","release":"2024-10-10","genres":["動作","射擊"],"players":"單機 1 人","langs":["英文"],"pmax":1,"poff":1,"rating":"ClassⅡ","size":"Switch 2 1.5GB / Switch 1.5GB","modes":["TV 模式","桌上模式","手提模式"],"shots":["https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/3e073c8988dd45fdbee98753e0a211fbf5a57c9fb68ef2a4b4b281cf68ff47d9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/05d0c27aa33151ae67d54862c1c07da360051bb5d8864f2166ce0cc090435ba9.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/50379c03aa41267af87e8102f3dbbc13fe6375dbd838723b973bf112206bde93.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/0c9e6b60981038f19e8edd13d4a7ab33a0e09ccca7990222f71f70f2fb312caf.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/e758b28ec9e21ef506de55a0714c8dc1a2701af957bebf679902a55b33007cc6.jpg","https://img-eshop.cdn.nintendo.net/i/163fb433943ccecbf2a026cb3b2108c310d9c9398280e4460e5758b957a31d31.jpg"],"titleId":"010083a0209da000","dlc":[]}